      "category": "nature",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Captain John Smith first charted the area in 1608, noting the large Nanticoke settlement of Chicacone where Vienna now stands.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.viennamd.org/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Vienna’s historic Handsell house earned a spot on the National Register of Historic Places in 2008.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
